{"text":{"en":{"테이퍼 핀 (Taper Pins) | [회사명] 베어링":"Taper Pins | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Taper Pins</p> <h2>테이퍼 핀 <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Taper Pins</span></h2> <p> 지름이 길이 방향으로 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">1/50 비율로 가늘어지는</strong> 원뿔형 핀으로, 축과 하우징을 정확한 위치에 고정합니다. 기본형(TP) 외에 끝단에 볼트를 낸 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">볼트형(BT/P)</strong>, 암나사를 낸 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">너트형(NT/P)</strong>도 함께 취급합니다. </p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Taper Pins</p> <h2>Taper Pin <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Taper Pins</span></h2> <p> A conical pin whose diameter <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">tapers at a ratio of 1/50</strong> along its length, used to fix a shaft and housing in an exact position. In addition to the standard type (TP), we also carry the <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">bolt type (BT/P)</strong>, which has a bolt formed at the end, and the <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">nut type (NT/P)</strong>, which has an internal thread. </p>","<svg width=\"240\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 240 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M40 35 L200 45 L200 55 L40 65 A15 15 0 0 1 40 35 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"></line> <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">d</text> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"112\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <text x=\"80\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#222\">TAPER 1/50</text> <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 기본형(TP)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=지름 · L=전체 길이</span></p>":"<svg width=\"240\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 240 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M40 35 L200 45 L200 55 L40 65 A15 15 0 0 1 40 35 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"></line> <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">d</text> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"112\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <text x=\"80\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#222\">TAPER 1/50</text> <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ Standard Type (TP)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=Diameter · L=Overall Length</span></p>","<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M90 44 L120 44 L120 56 L90 56\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M92 44 Q96 47 92 50 Q96 53 92 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M98 44 Q102 47 98 50 Q102 53 98 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M104 44 Q108 47 104 50 Q108 53 104 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M110 44 Q114 47 110 50 Q114 53 110 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 볼트형(B<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>":"<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M90 44 L120 44 L120 56 L90 56\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M92 44 Q96 47 92 50 Q96 53 92 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M98 44 Q102 47 98 50 Q102 53 98 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M104 44 Q108 47 104 50 Q108 53 104 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M110 44 Q114 47 110 50 Q114 53 110 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ Bolt Type (B<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>","<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"90\" y=\"46\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"94\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"94\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"106\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"112\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 너트형(N<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>":"<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"90\" y=\"46\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"94\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"94\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"106\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"112\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ Nut Type (N<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>","△ 표시 사이즈, 볼트형(BT/P)·너트형(NT/P)은 주문제작":"△ marked sizes, bolt type (BT/P) and nut type (NT/P) are made to order","<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">테이퍼핀 생산 길이 범위</h3> <p style=\"font-size: 13.5px;\"> 규격(호칭지름)별로 기본형(TP)·암TP(테이퍼 홀 가공용)·숫TP 세 종류의 생산 가능 길이 범위입니다. 동일 범위 내에서도 5mm 단위로 세분화된 사이즈가 빠질 수 있어, 정확한 재고 길이는 발주 전 문의 바랍니다. </p>":"<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Taper Pin Production Length Range</h3> <p style=\"font-size: 13.5px;\"> These are the producible length ranges for the standard type (TP), female TP (for machining taper holes), and male TP, by nominal diameter. Even within the same range, sizes in 5mm increments may be missing, so please check with us before ordering for exact in-stock lengths. </p>","규격(d)":"Spec (d)","암TP":"Female TP","숫TP":"Male TP","<strong>재질 · 용도</strong><br> 용도: 축과 하우징 고정용 · 재질: SM45C":"<strong>Material · Application</strong><br> Application: Fixing shafts and housings · Material: SM45C","※ 위 도면과 표는 당사 정식 규격표 원본을 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 견적 문의를 통해 재고와 최종 치수를 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ The drawing and table above were prepared based on our official standard specification table original. Please always confirm stock and final dimensions with a quote inquiry before precision machining or ordering."},"ja":{"테이퍼 핀 (Taper Pins) | [회사명] 베어링":"テーパーピン (Taper Pins) | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Taper Pins</p> <h2>테이퍼 핀 <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Taper Pins</span></h2> <p> 지름이 길이 방향으로 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">1/50 비율로 가늘어지는</strong> 원뿔형 핀으로, 축과 하우징을 정확한 위치에 고정합니다. 기본형(TP) 외에 끝단에 볼트를 낸 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">볼트형(BT/P)</strong>, 암나사를 낸 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">너트형(NT/P)</strong>도 함께 취급합니다. </p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Taper Pins</p> <h2>テーパーピン <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Taper Pins</span></h2> <p> 直径が長さ方向に<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">1/50の比率で細くなる</strong>円錐形のピンで、軸とハウジングを正確な位置に固定します。基本形(TP)のほか、先端にボルトを設けた<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">ボルト形(BT/P)</strong>、めねじを設けた<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">ナット形(NT/P)</strong>も取り扱っています。 </p>","<svg width=\"240\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 240 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M40 35 L200 45 L200 55 L40 65 A15 15 0 0 1 40 35 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"></line> <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">d</text> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"112\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <text x=\"80\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#222\">TAPER 1/50</text> <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 기본형(TP)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=지름 · L=전체 길이</span></p>":"<svg width=\"240\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 240 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M40 35 L200 45 L200 55 L40 65 A15 15 0 0 1 40 35 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"></line> <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">d</text> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"112\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <text x=\"80\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#222\">TAPER 1/50</text> <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 基本形(TP)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=直径 ・ L=全長</span></p>","<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M90 44 L120 44 L120 56 L90 56\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M92 44 Q96 47 92 50 Q96 53 92 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M98 44 Q102 47 98 50 Q102 53 98 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M104 44 Q108 47 104 50 Q108 53 104 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M110 44 Q114 47 110 50 Q114 53 110 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 볼트형(B<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>":"<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M90 44 L120 44 L120 56 L90 56\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M92 44 Q96 47 92 50 Q96 53 92 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M98 44 Q102 47 98 50 Q102 53 98 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M104 44 Q108 47 104 50 Q108 53 104 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M110 44 Q114 47 110 50 Q114 53 110 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ ボルト形(B<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>","<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"90\" y=\"46\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"94\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"94\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"106\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"112\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 너트형(N<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>":"<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"90\" y=\"46\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"94\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"94\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"106\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"112\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ ナット形(N<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>","△ 표시 사이즈, 볼트형(BT/P)·너트형(NT/P)은 주문제작":"△印のサイズ、ボルト形(BT/P)・ナット形(NT/P)は受注生産","<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">테이퍼핀 생산 길이 범위</h3> <p style=\"font-size: 13.5px;\"> 규격(호칭지름)별로 기본형(TP)·암TP(테이퍼 홀 가공용)·숫TP 세 종류의 생산 가능 길이 범위입니다. 동일 범위 내에서도 5mm 단위로 세분화된 사이즈가 빠질 수 있어, 정확한 재고 길이는 발주 전 문의 바랍니다. </p>":"<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">テーパーピン生産長さ範囲</h3> <p style=\"font-size: 13.5px;\"> 規格(呼び径)別に、基本形(TP)・めすTP(テーパー穴加工用)・おすTPの3種類の生産可能な長さ範囲です。同一範囲内でも5mm単位で細分化されたサイズが欠けている場合があるため、正確な在庫長さは発注前にお問い合わせください。 </p>","규격(d)":"規格(d)","암TP":"めすTP","숫TP":"おすTP","<strong>재질 · 용도</strong><br> 용도: 축과 하우징 고정용 · 재질: SM45C":"<strong>材質・用途</strong><br> 用途: 軸とハウジングの固定用 ・ 材質: SM45C","※ 위 도면과 표는 당사 정식 규격표 원본을 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 견적 문의를 통해 재고와 최종 치수를 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ 上記の図面と表は当社正式規格表原本を基準に作成しました。精密加工・発注前には必ず見積もり問い合わせを通じて在庫と最終寸法をご確認ください。"},"zh":{"테이퍼 핀 (Taper Pins) | [회사명] 베어링":"锥销 (Taper Pins) | [公司名] 轴承","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Taper Pins</p> <h2>테이퍼 핀 <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Taper Pins</span></h2> <p> 지름이 길이 방향으로 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">1/50 비율로 가늘어지는</strong> 원뿔형 핀으로, 축과 하우징을 정확한 위치에 고정합니다. 기본형(TP) 외에 끝단에 볼트를 낸 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">볼트형(BT/P)</strong>, 암나사를 낸 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">너트형(NT/P)</strong>도 함께 취급합니다. </p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Taper Pins</p> <h2>锥销 <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500;\">Taper Pins</span></h2> <p> 直径沿长度方向<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">以1/50的比例逐渐变细</strong>的圆锥形销,用于将轴与壳体固定在精确位置。除基本型(TP)外,还提供端部带螺栓的<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">螺栓型(BT/P)</strong>及设有内螺纹的<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">螺母型(NT/P)</strong>。 </p>","<svg width=\"240\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 240 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M40 35 L200 45 L200 55 L40 65 A15 15 0 0 1 40 35 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"></line> <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">d</text> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"112\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <text x=\"80\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#222\">TAPER 1/50</text> <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 기본형(TP)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=지름 · L=전체 길이</span></p>":"<svg width=\"240\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 240 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M40 35 L200 45 L200 55 L40 65 A15 15 0 0 1 40 35 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"></line> <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">d</text> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"112\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <text x=\"80\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#222\">TAPER 1/50</text> <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 基本型(TP)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=直径 · L=全长</span></p>","<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M90 44 L120 44 L120 56 L90 56\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M92 44 Q96 47 92 50 Q96 53 92 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M98 44 Q102 47 98 50 Q102 53 98 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M104 44 Q108 47 104 50 Q108 53 104 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M110 44 Q114 47 110 50 Q114 53 110 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 볼트형(B<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>":"<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M90 44 L120 44 L120 56 L90 56\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M92 44 Q96 47 92 50 Q96 53 92 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M98 44 Q102 47 98 50 Q102 53 98 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M104 44 Q108 47 104 50 Q108 53 104 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> <path d=\"M110 44 Q114 47 110 50 Q114 53 110 56\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"></path> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 螺栓型(B<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>","<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"90\" y=\"46\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"94\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"94\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"106\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"112\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 너트형(N<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>":"<svg width=\"150\" height=\"110\" viewbox=\"0 0 150 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M20 40 L90 46 L90 54 L20 60 A12 12 0 0 1 20 40 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <rect x=\"90\" y=\"46\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"></rect> <line x1=\"94\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"94\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"106\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <line x1=\"112\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 螺母型(N<sup>T</sup>⁄<sub>P</sub>)</p>","△ 표시 사이즈, 볼트형(BT/P)·너트형(NT/P)은 주문제작":"△标记尺寸、螺栓型(BT/P)・螺母型(NT/P)为订制生产","<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">테이퍼핀 생산 길이 범위</h3> <p style=\"font-size: 13.5px;\"> 규격(호칭지름)별로 기본형(TP)·암TP(테이퍼 홀 가공용)·숫TP 세 종류의 생산 가능 길이 범위입니다. 동일 범위 내에서도 5mm 단위로 세분화된 사이즈가 빠질 수 있어, 정확한 재고 길이는 발주 전 문의 바랍니다. </p>":"<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">锥销生产长度范围</h3> <p style=\"font-size: 13.5px;\"> 按规格(公称直径)划分的基本型(TP)・母TP(用于加工锥孔)・公TP三种可生产长度范围。同一范围内也可能存在以5mm为单位细分的尺寸缺口,准确的现货长度请在下单前咨询确认。 </p>","규격(d)":"规格(d)","암TP":"母TP","숫TP":"公TP","<strong>재질 · 용도</strong><br> 용도: 축과 하우징 고정용 · 재질: SM45C":"<strong>材质・用途</strong><br> 用途: 用于固定轴与壳体 · 材质: SM45C","※ 위 도면과 표는 당사 정식 규격표 원본을 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 견적 문의를 통해 재고와 최종 치수를 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ 以上图纸与表格均依据本公司正式规格表原本制作。精密加工・下单前请务必通过询价确认库存与最终尺寸。"}},"attrs":{"en":{},"ja":{},"zh":{}}}